        "title": "Fantastic, for the price, extra extra fantastic",
        "text": "I didn't expect much of these due to the price. I am kinda blown away by how good they are. I purchased them for use on kayaks. I'm using them everywhere. Only criticism, the beam paths do not adjust downward enough. It sets the work area far ahead. Great for trail, but not for close up stuff. I rig a little something up the splash the light down more into the area where I require light. Cannot complain, really, due to the cost. Comes with a very nice waterproof carrying case, gasket sealed.",
